# DIAGNOSTICS

`CROI_ERR_BAD_HANDLE`, `CROI_ERR_WRONG_TYPE` and `CROI_ERR_ACCESS_DENIED` as for any handle; see syscall(2).
`CROI_ERR_INVALID_ARGS`: bad options or counts as above, or an unwritable <out> or <packets>.
`CROI_ERR_NO_MEMORY`: no memory for a packet.

